# Ports the Production host may serve to the internet (#464).
#
# One entry per line: <proto>/<port> [from=<cidr>] <owner>: <reason>
# The external probe (scripts/ops/monitoring/probe-public-ports.sh) alerts on
# any other open port, and the guard (scripts/ops/firewall/docker-user-guard.sh)
# drops any published container port not listed here. A port another project
# wants public is added here with that project as its owner, in a reviewed
# change, before the guard runs.
tcp/22   AIHUB operator: sshd, key-only (#570)
tcp/80   AIHUB operator: host nginx, redirects to HTTPS
tcp/443  AIHUB operator: host nginx, the public AIHUB and Customer Web hostnames
